# linux-libc-dev kernel-header CVEs newly disclosed since v1.4.0, from the pinned
# PyTorch/CUDA worker base (also inherited by the worker-io image, which adds no
# CVEs of its own). Same rationale as the batches above: these flag the kernel
# *header* package version, not the running kernel — a container shares the host's
# kernel, so the in-image linux-libc-dev version is not a runtime exposure for the
# worker. This batch includes two CRITICALs (CVE-2025-71068 svcrdma, CVE-2026-23216
# scsi/iscsi use-after-free); the rest are HIGH. Accepted until a newer PyTorch
# base ships patched headers.
#   Owner: maintainers. Review by: 2026-10-10.
